Error [E0112]: `guard.map` needs a field projection
  --> local_cell_guard_map_rejects_detached_values.jet:4:32
    |
  4 |     _ :: cell.guard_read().map(pair -> pair.left + pair.right)
    |                                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A mapped guard must point into the value covered by its original dynamic loan
 Fix: Write `.map(value -> value.field)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0112
